// mumax3 skyrmion relaxation -> topological charge, for the precision-sensitivity
// cross-code check. Same Co/Pt disk as Claude-SD P1 (Dc = 4.41 mJ/m^2).
// DIND is substituted by the harness; minimize() is deterministic in mumax3, so
// one Q per D — compared against the Claude-SD run-to-run distribution.
SetGridSize(100, 100, 1)
SetCellSize(2e-9, 2e-9, 1e-9)

Msat  = 800e3
Aex   = 15e-12
Ku1   = 0.8e6
anisU = vector(0, 0, 1)
alpha = 0.3
Dind  = DIND_PLACEHOLDER

// seed: mz=-1 disk (r<20nm) in a +z background
m = uniform(0, 0, 1)
DefRegion(1, circle(20e-9))
m.setRegion(1, uniform(0, 0, -1))

relax()
tableAdd(ext_topologicalcharge)
tableSave()
save(m)
